<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .logo-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 80px;
    height: auto;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .university-name h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .contact-info p {
    margin: 2px 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .main-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .main-title h2 {
    font-size: 20pt;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section h3 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 25px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .warning-box {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    background-color: #f9f9f9;
  }
  .warning-box h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-section">
      <div class="logo">
        <!-- Placeholder for logo image -->
      </div>
      <div class="university-name">
        <h1>Palm Beach Atlantic UNIVERSITY</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <p>Financial Aid Office</p>
      <p>901 South Flagler Drive</p>
      <p>P.O. Box 24708</p>
      <p>West Palm Beach, FL 33416-4708</p>
      <p>Phone: {{ contact_phone }}</p>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="main-title">
    <h2>Graduate PLUS Loan Application</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Instructions:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Go to <a href="{{ application_url }}">{{ application_url }}</a>.</li>
      <li>Hover over the second tab <span data-field="tab_name">{{ tab_name }}</span>.</li>
      <li>Click <span data-field="button_text">{{ button_text }}</span>.</li>
      <li>Under the green lined box titled <span data-field="box_title">{{ box_title }}</span>, click <span data-field="login_link">{{ login_link }}</span>.</li>
      <li>Enter your FSA ID Username and FSA ID Password.</li>
      <li>Complete the required fields in all 4 sections of the application. At the end of the application, you will be informed if your application has been approved or denied. PBA will be notified automatically within 48 hours of your completion.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="warning-box">
    <h3>If your application is approved:</h3>
    <p>Continue the on-screen instructions to complete the Graduate PLUS Master Promissory Note (MPN). After both the applications have been completed, the loan will be added to your account within 48 hours.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="warning-box" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3>If your application is denied:</h3>
    <p>When a Graduate PLUS application is denied, multiple options for proceeding will be displayed.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Option 1: You can choose to no longer pursue the Graduate PLUS loan.</li>
      <li>Option 2: You can pursue an endorser by following the instructions online.</li>
      <li>Option 3: If you believe that you should not have been denied for the Graduate PLUS loan, you may appeal the decision by calling the Student Loan Support Center at 1-800-557-7394.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>